rn back if you're not ready to take on the consequences!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909270/extras/d699662c122593936bbc252b1bd4c8af.poster.avif?t=1735930017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909270/extras/d699662c122593936bbc252b1bd4c8af.webm?t=1735930017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909270/extras/d699662c122593936bbc252b1bd4c8af.mp4?t=1735930017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Features</h2>\u30fbSimple &amp; captivating puzzles<br><br>\u30fbCute illustrations and sticky tentacles<br>\u30fbA complete and compelling storyline",
